>Biuya</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）的成员包括吉他手张秋爽、贝斯手元帅及鼓手赵九龙。</span><span>2008</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年结成至今，乐队走走停停，虽然算不上坎坷却也经历了不少颠簸，而</span><span>1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">张小样</span><span>EP</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">《</span><span>Demo.1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">》、</span><span>2</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">张全长专辑《常青树》、《阴天王国》的成绩也只是差强人意。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">在有限输出的表象背后，成员们自知几年来的进步与沉淀，在了解自身局限的同时也懂得了绕道去罗马不失为一种好方法。好的表达需要学会采纳和摒弃，好的音乐表达同样如此，采纳什么、摒弃什么，成员们心里越来越清楚。</span><span><br/> “</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">我们不过是时代一角的一届路人</span><span>——</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">今天过后、明天没有人会记得的少数派。</span><span>”<br/> 10</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年的时光已经过去，去到的地方也许会永闪荣光，错过的风景也许会令人永远好奇，而犹豫过、迷惘过、恐惧过的地方一定会列入新的征程。</span></p><p><br/></p>","dateStart":false,"dateEnd":false,"url":"/artist___UrEoDGkv8m.html","nameTimeline":"不优雅签约赤瞳音乐","firstLetter":"B","letters":"BUYOUYA","docAliasSearch":"签约","title":"不优雅","stitle":"Biuya","dateYear":"Invalid date ","dateTimeline":"12/20","dateYYYYM":" 202112","dateMM":" 12月","dateFull":"2021-12-20","percentDateOfYear":"96.978","docAlias":"artists","id":"UrEoDGkv8m"}],"sImg":"/static/upload/images/rubyeyes/records/20210730/1627628468480403428.jpg","doc":"Record","date":"2017-09-24T00:00:00.000Z","listLinks":[],"_id":"liyKwXqa4H","name":"不优雅2017巡演Live","alias":"buyouya2017xunyanLive","dateRelease":"2017-09-24T00:00:00.000Z","url":"/record___liyKwXqa4H.html","nameTimeline":"专辑《不优雅2017巡演Live》发布","listArtists":[{"doc":"Artist","_id":"UrEoDGkv8m","name":"不优雅","alias":"Biuya","comments":"<p><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">不优雅（</span><span>Biuya</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">）的成员包括吉他手张秋爽、贝斯手元帅及鼓手赵九龙。</span><span>2008</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">年结成至今，乐队走走停停，虽然算不上坎坷却也经历了不少颠簸，而</span><span>1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">张小样</span><span>EP</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">《</span><span>Demo.1</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">》